# Fallback sandbox location, used only if `sandbox_root` is missing from
# worker/config.json. The real sandboxes live at C:\forge-models\worker-sandboxes
# -- off the synced drive, because OneDrive locks freshly written files and turns
# a gate red for reasons the worker cannot see (see worker/CALIBRATION.md).
#
# Either way: never commit them. A stale copy of service/ sitting next to the
# real one is a trap for grep and for the next agent.
*
!.gitignore
